/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   F — THE WORKING COPY · the homepage.

   An annotated printed file. Light, ruled, dense at rest; it animates
   only when the visitor acts. Ported from the approved prototype
   onto the app's real primitives —
   and past it: the prototype's client-simulated guestbook is REAL here
   (a live @action with Pydantic validation, rate limiting and per-visitor
   storage — the honesty scheme described below), and the
   request-log pane's every number is measured, not quoted.

   STATIC-FIRST: the full document — all 33 printed lines, seed entries,
   the FIG, the complete terminal transcript — is the server-rendered
   HTML. Boot print and reveals are CSS gated on `html.js` + `.seen`;
   with JS off the whole argument reads at rest. SSR markup == first
   client render everywhere: `useSeen` starts false on both, measured
   values (nav timing, my_entries) land post-mount only, and every
   animation delay is a deterministic inline style.

   MOTION: diegetic only — the boot print (once), act-to-animate flashes
   on the real guestbook request, one FIG draw + race, one terminal
   replay of a real captured session, breathing LIVE dots. No framer
   needed; everything dies under prefers-reduced-motion.
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ── the printed specimen — pages/guestbook.pyxl, 33 lines ──────────
   Verbatim the file that `pyxle check` passes against the site's own
   db.py (db.recent / db.add are this site's real module API — plan §2).
   Segments: plain = Ink, c = Graphite (punctuation · strings), g = Run
   Green (only the anatomy that runs — green job 5). `dsk`/`mob` pairs
   are the same characters reflowed for the phone column. */
const T = (s) => ({ s });
const C = (s) => ({ s, k: 'c' });
const G = (s) => ({ s, k: 'g' });

const SPEC_ROWS = [
